      "id": "claim_ecbd14f123d447469dd29fad300451c0",
      "statement": "Each Sensorboard-to-Display topic (ctrl, imu, bat, tank, hx, gas, bme_in, bme_out, elec) updates only its own slice of the Display's merged sensor-data snapshot; other fields are preserved across updates, and unknown or missing JSON fields are tolerated rather than causing errors.",
