    {
      "id": "claim_0921cef56c0b4a83a1cfa29237ae6846",
      "statement": "Despite the project's protocol documentation describing the Sensorboard link as physical RS485, the current Display firmware source shows the live transport has been migrated to ESP-NOW: firmware/shared/womo_config.h documents 'ESP-NOW Transport (ersetzt RS485)', womo_sensorboard_init() is annotated as initializing ESP-NOW, and main/espnow/womo_espnow.c implements broadcast-then-unicast peer discovery and frame transport over esp_now, with main.c logging an 'ESP-NOW Handshake' on first data receipt.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://firmware/display/main/espnow/womo_espnow.c#L1-L100",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f955a3c601d2600f30e23e1c5e425010d3fafac39fe95222400fb6374b52379d:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://firmware/display/main/main.c#L5070-L5096",
