    {
      "id": "claim_a08640ff93cb40a999a51d9769f21db4",
      "statement": "The Display tracks outstanding Sensorboard commands by sequence number and label with a 3 s ACK timeout, and separately runs a 5-minute link-timeout watchdog that raises the sensor error stack's RS485/sensor-link entry when no packet has arrived; GPS/LTE fields in the merged snapshot are written only by a separate 15 s router_poll_task so the two data sources never overwrite each other.",
      "evidence": [
