    {
      "id": "claim_796ac59d080d432f9b49c98c311b93d4",
      "statement": "The Display polls the Teltonika RUTX11 router over UCI JSON-RPC/ubus via HTTP (default IP 192.168.55.1) for WLAN client status, LTE/modem status, GPS position, and WLAN scan results, refreshing AP/WLAN/LTE/GPS state every 15 seconds via router_poll_task, and serializes outbound TLS sessions to external APIs through a shared HTTP mutex to avoid exhausting mbedTLS resources.",
