    {
      "id": "claim_46693db38abe4e1fa517d20c3cd4ff50",
      "statement": "firmware/shared/womo_config.h values (heartbeat interval, command timeout, per-topic update intervals, router IP, ESP-NOW fallback channel/payload-size/queue-depth) must be identical between the Display and Sensorboard firmware images, requiring both to be rebuilt and reflashed after any change; NVS namespaces on the Display persist router WLAN credentials (rtr_wifi), the ESP32's own known-WLAN pool (wifi_cfg/known_list), AP hotspot credentials, thresholds, and Ruuvi/GasBee sensor-slot mappings.",
